        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KK4xdEVbso1Bxrx4uSClDN8LgMX\"><em><strong>The charts below show the proportion of holidaymakers using four different types of accommodation in three different years. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Holiday Accommodation Types: Three Years</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y3fHd46nEo3nsOxEUCVlJGGqgmf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-pie-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Giới thiệu dạng Pie Charts</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KgoWdafigoJ7Y3xvnmclqJ38grg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Holiday Accommodation Types: Three Years y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả phần trăm người đi nghỉ lễ sử dụng 4 loại h&igrave;nh cư tr&uacute; kh&aacute;c nhau qua ba năm 1988, 1998, 2008.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K56Sd1Isgod07kxQ1R3lOzgfg9d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></a></strong> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpmKdnTVvoCliux0721ldgOJgdb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Holiday Accommodation Types: Three Years với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: phần trăm người đi nghỉ lễ - loại h&igrave;nh cư tr&uacute; - giai đoạn 20 năm gồm 1988, 1998, 2008.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U1xeddreJolzOUxP5Z0lxpjSgsd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Pie Charts</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-pie\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng Pie</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HBJLdorasotac9xk723lTjoAg9g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WX6Hd7eA8odriFxhJAKlIfzzgKd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O3H8dwWZVoI8QuxN7ODlOgd0g8z\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>staying with family v&agrave; camping giảm, hotels v&agrave; rented apartments tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OX0dd3PR3oUEGOx4vJXlU8B3gHd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>staying with family lu&ocirc;n l&agrave; loại h&igrave;nh phổ biến nhất xuy&ecirc;n suốt giai đoạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;n</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iv2pdg97YoEmwkx8LjKlzkbhgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FDEMd2TadoWZ8SxhKAElWam3guf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RSzMdJOX0o4D08xvsK4lVcIQgAf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Nh&oacute;m staying with family v&agrave; hotels</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SJXMdhgQKoeOwnxUOx7lNbZFgfb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X43Wd5WD3oSuv0x34xFlglG6g3f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1988 </strong><em>(staying with family chiếm hơn 1 nửa, c&ograve;n hotels chiếm 15%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LEtjdVX1zo1KW9xMwUllgHW2gyg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của staying with family </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng nhẹ</strong></em><em> đạt 54% v&agrave;o 1998 v&agrave; giảm đạt 44% v&agrave;o năm 2008)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M55vdx5JmoUjTVxbBQHlOfGNgrh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của hotels </strong><em>(tăng</em><em><strong> </strong></em><em>đạt 22% v&agrave;o 1998 v&agrave; 2008)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tw5QdMsmgo3Bf8xkcK5lDu6OgZo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AJardnGJXof1wMxyjQSlnZX5god\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Nh&oacute;m camping v&agrave; rented apartments</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BA2Nd3aZyoUEO0xxv0ilR4Cwgvg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4JldePMcojqncxdOhzlBOV9gjk\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1988 </strong><em>(cắm trại được chọn bởi hơn </em><em><strong>1/4</strong></em><em> c&aacute;c holidaymakers, rented apartments chiếm 7%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T9u4dr4iRo3v95xObjkleTzog8e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của camping </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm một nửa</strong></em><em> đạt 13% v&agrave;o năm 1998, v&agrave; tiếp tục </em><em><strong>giảm nhẹ</strong></em><em> đạt 12% v&agrave;o năm 2008)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EA2td3vlAo5cXZxPk02lcW3xgUh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của rented apartments </strong><em>(tăng đạt 11% năm 1998, v&agrave; </em><em><strong>tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong></em><em> đạt 22% năm 2008)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XLrldOBdEoLn16xoLpzlJ9prgzd\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasin</strong><strong>g</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6Q5dNsjTogsZxxKU2qlf4WmgLb\">\n<div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2MCdvXR5oooHCxOvw2lEnlngwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YYwxdNB3wo0hjlxvlWhlXI3ogTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SXP0dt4N6oXMDqxEMg2lk3aGg2e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt việc&nbsp;<strong>\"ở nh&agrave; với gia đ&igrave;nh trong dịp lễ\"</strong>, thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"staying with family\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"enjoying holidays at their family's homes\"</strong> để c&acirc;u văn của m&igrave;nh đa dạng hơn nh&eacute; (v&agrave; nhớ ch&uacute; &yacute; danh từ số &iacute;t / số nhiều)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CNlhdZLmfob4uPx01jrlW9fXgof\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UjCJd2EZXoml9Gxp5sglIKesgTb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Regarding the two most common types of accommodation, <strong>enjoying holidays at their family's homes</strong> accounted for more than half of all holidaymakers in 1988, at 52%.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 435,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVjWdJ3tRoRDp6xJzn6ldMjDgye\">The pie charts illustrate the percentages of holidaymakers choosing four different types of accommodation over a period of 20 years, namely 1988, 1998 and 2008.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13796,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 436,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, staying with family remained the most popular choice throughout the period shown, despite experiencing a decline towards the end. Additionally, while the proportion of people camping decreased significantly, there were notable rises in those opting for both hotels and rented apartments.</p>",
            "question_id": 13796,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 437,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the two most common types of accommodation, enjoying holidays at their family's homes accounted for more than half of all holidaymakers in 1988, at 52%. This figure saw a slight increase to 54% in 1998, before dropping to 44% in the final year. Meanwhile, hotels were chosen by only 15% of travelers in 1988, but this proportion rose to 22% in both 1998 and 2008.</p>",
            "question_id": 13796,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 438,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ACNqd0B75oZyEcxANWwlqwVDggc\">Regarding the remaining options, camping was initially the second most popular choice, selected by approximately a quarter of holidaymakers in 1988. However, this figure halved to 13% in 1998 and continued to decline slightly to 12% in 2008. In contrast, rented apartments showed a steady upward trend, rising from just 7% in 1988 to 11% a decade later, before doubling to 22% by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
